meta {
  name: Terminate provided transfer
  type: http
  seq: 20
}

post {
  url: {{mgmtUrl}}/v1/provided-transfers/{{mgmtProvidedTransferPid}}/termination
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 202
  res.body.providerPid: isDefined
}

docs {
  The provider ends a transfer on its own (1.1, ADR 0027). Access ends at once:
  the data flow is terminated and every running download of it is cut. The DSP
  TransferTerminationMessage goes to the consumer in the background; the state
  becomes TERMINATED once the consumer acknowledges it, or cannot be reached.
  Asked again while the termination is on its way, it answers the same.
  400 once the transfer has ended; 404 for an unknown providerPid.
}
